---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | JobAgent"
  description="JobAgent Terms of Service: the agreement covering use of this site and its content."
>
  <main class="legal">
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: September 11, 2026</p>

    <section>
      <h2>1. Acceptance</h2>
      <p>
        Welcome to JobAgent (the "Site"). By accessing or using the Site you agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Site Content</h2>
      <p>
        Content on the Site is provided "as is" for product introduction purposes and may change as the product evolves. We strive for accuracy but make no express or implied warranties regarding completeness or timeliness.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        The Site's copy, design, and branding belong to the project team and may not be used commercially without permission. Open-source code is governed by the license declared in its repository.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>
        Do not use the Site in ways that could harm or disrupt its operation or infringe on others' rights, including malicious scraping, injection attacks, or impersonation of the Site.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Product Development Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is in the product development stage. All feature descriptions and data are product concept drafts and do not constitute any commitment or offer. Demo area sample data is for display purposes only and does not represent real users or real analysis results.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, the Site is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from use of or inability to use its content.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        These terms may be updated; changes will be posted on this page. Continued use of the Site constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions can be raised via Issues on our
        <a href="https://github.com/bayernjf/job-agent" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub repository</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
